        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Punk: a MVC framework]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[<a href="https://metacpan.org/pod/Punk">Punk</a> is web framework that does a lot of computation at startup and then it is (supposed to be) much faster. It also means that errors move to boot time so you find out about them sooner. It is a clear win.]]></description>
            <pubDate>2026.08.07</pubDate>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">https://dev.to/lnation/punk-a-mvc-framework-b23</guid>
